    "body": "See https://github.com/whatwg/html/blob/master/FAQ.md#html-should-support-href-on-any-element. This indeed doesn't give you native UI for the entire row and it would be nice to offer that, but it's basically too much added complexity for a minor win. (We also cannot really change the HTML parser so that's not a viable route.)",
